\f0\b \cf2 1. Load (Intensity/Volume)
\f1\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Often, the movement itself is safe, but the current tissue capacity is exceeded. Reducing the absolute weight or the total volume allows the athlete to groove the pattern without crossing the nociceptive threshold.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Reduce the weight from 135 lbs to 95 lbs. If pain persists, proceed to the next variable.\cell \row

