\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 The core logic engine operates on continuous variables, requiring precise quantification of resistance training exposures. The foundational objective is to manage the stimulus-to-fatigue ratio optimally across varying user demographics and training ages.\

